Package: aura
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCHITECTURE@
Maintainer: John Olafenwa <35049820+johnolafenwa@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.39), libstdc++6, zlib1g, libzstd1
Recommends: gcc, libc6-dev
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://johnolafenwa.github.io/Aura/
Description: Compiler and tools for the Aura programming language
 Aura is a statically typed, compiled language with Python-like syntax.
 This package holds the `aura` command and the native runtime that
 `aura build` links into programs.
 .
 `aura build` and native `aura run` need a C compiler and linker, which the
 recommended gcc and libc6-dev packages provide.
